# Test 1: Starting MySQL with the ONLY_DSTORE under different transaction_isolation.
# Test 1.1: Restart server with ONLY_DSTORE and REPEATABLE-READ.
# restart failed
# Kill the server
Pattern "storage_engine_mode is set to ONLY_DSTORE. For ONLY_DSTORE, do not allow to use REPEATABLE-READ transaction isolation." found
# ----- Test 1.1 succeeded -----
# Test 1.2: Restart server with ONLY_DSTORE and READ-UNCOMMITTED.
# Should succeed
# ----- Test 1.2 succeeded -----
# Test 1.3: Restart server with ONLY_DSTORE and READ-COMMITTED.
# Should succeed
# ----- Test 1.3 succeeded -----
